</li>
<li data-start="261" data-end="371">
<p data-start="263" data-end="371"><strong data-start="263" data-end="289">Sleek Vertical Design:</strong> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]">The segmented vertical layout offers a contemporary aesthetic, seamlessly integrating with various interior styles.</span>​</p>
</li>
<li data-start="373" data-end="479">
<p data-start="375" data-end="479"><strong data-start="375" data-end="397">Premium Materials:</strong> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]">Constructed with high-quality acrylic and metal components, ensuring durability and a refined appearance.</span>​</p>
</li>
<li data-start="481" data-end="587">
<p data-start="483" data-end="587"><strong data-start="483" data-end="503">Low Maintenance:</strong> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem]">The fully enclosed system requires minimal upkeep, providing continuous enjoyment without extensive maintenance efforts.</span>​</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="589" data-end="615"><strong data-start="589" data-end="615">Customization Options:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="617" data-end="1224">
